# Optional: a form submission endpoint (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx)
# that accepts a multipart/form-data POST and returns JSON.
# If left unset, the contact form falls back to opening a pre-filled mailto
# link — no backend, no secrets, no build-time requirement.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Optional: WhatsApp number in international format, digits only — no "+",
# spaces, brackets or hyphens (e.g. 254712345678).
# When set, WhatsApp contact buttons appear in the navigation, the contact
# section and a floating action button. When unset, the WhatsApp UI is
# hidden entirely — no number is ever invented or guessed.
VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=
